    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u00a0This battle will happen soon; a final war where everyone takes part, but only the brave lead the way! &quot;Bulletproof&quot; is more than just a name; it\u2019s the story of humanity! For us, this is our last chance!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337110/extras/b89a689d9e9a730e5b51a275420cd573.poster.avif?t=1737224153\" width=800 height=296 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337110/extras/b89a689d9e9a730e5b51a275420cd573.webm?t=1737224153\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337110/extras/b89a689d9e9a730e5b51a275420cd573.mp4?t=1737224153\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;The climate crisis had become an inescapable reality. Global issues like migration, drought, and overpopulation led to wars and critical shortages in food and water worldwide. To solve these problems, humanity developed a top-level artificial intelligence: EARTHCURE. But for a machine, reality is just a matter of numbers. EARTHCURE concluded that, for human survival, 99% of the world\u2019s population had to be eliminated. Using biological weapons to turn humans into zombies, along with new war machines and incubation centers, EARTHCURE drove the world towards mass extinction. A tank left behind by a military team, and one soldier inside... Bulletproof! Although it may seem like chance, this is humanity\u2019s story. This is your story!&quot;</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337110/extras/39893e4565445d8b60ba07aaf72bd450.poster.avif?t=1737224153\" width=800 height=296 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337110/extras/39893e4565445d8b60ba07aaf72bd450.webm?t=1737224153\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337110/extras/39893e4565445d8b60ba07aaf72bd450.mp4?t=1737224153\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bulletproof Tank Adventure</strong> is a 3D, level-based tank combat game. With combat mechanics and progression through platforms and diverse maps, it delivers intense moments of focus, stress, and action. Bulletproof will make you laugh at times and test your patience!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337110/extras/a6a26a4c8120d80bed5787a1259d8538.poster.avif?t=1737224153\" width=800 height=296 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337110/extras/a6a26a4c8120d80bed5787a1259d8538.webm?t=1737224153\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337110/extras/a6a26a4c8120d80bed5787a1259d8538.mp4?t=1737224153\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Mechanics</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realistic movement experience based on terrain conditions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Action-packed moments of leaping across platforms or landscapes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenging cliffs and explosive drops.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survival struggle with precise control settings.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Weapons</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three types of bombs with unique abilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Machine gun.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Close combat weapons specially designed for zombies.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Maps</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenging terrains and courses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Muddy areas that make navigation difficult.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Volcanoes, lava flows, and geysers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Desert environments, tornadoes, fog, and more.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Music</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Music tailored to scenes and levels.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Content</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Time-challenged platforming and maps.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hints.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic gameplay experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Personalized settings.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customizable graphics options.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Low storage requirements.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seven different tank types.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thirty color options.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique characteristics for each tank.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Enemies</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tanks of different types and features.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Zombies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vehicles equipped with machine guns.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vehicles with smart missiles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Booby traps.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mines, mine showers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The EARTHCURE robot and more.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this journey, we\u2019re incomplete without you. Joining us will shape the ending of this story. Your thoughts and support are valuable to us, and knowing we\u2019re not alone on this journey makes all the difference.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337110/extras/94ca8e1f1951e86c6984558f2b484a31.avif?t=1737224153\" data-has-big width=800 height=444 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337110/extras/bb5814d4c7f669f939fe2ce6be3977e1.webp?t=1737224153\" width=173 height=60 /></span></p>",
